# Spider-Ham, Peter Porker {1}{G}, 2/2 Spider Boar Hero: "When Spider-Ham enters, create a Food token" - one - and "Other Spiders, Boars, Bats, Bears, ... and Wolves you
# control get +1/+1." Bot1 casts Spider-Ham, a Grizzly Bears (a Bear: 3/3) and a Masked Meower (a Spider Cat Hero, two of the listed types, still just +1/+1: 2/2). Spider-Ham himself
# is no "other" Spider or Boar and stays 2/2. On turn 3 Llanowar Elves (an Elf Druid) stays 1/1. Bot2's Grizzly Bears (turn 2) is an opponent's and stays 2/2. When Bot2's Lightning
# Bolt kills Spider-Ham on turn 2 the bonus goes with him: the Bears is 2/2 and the Meower 1/1 again.

